  "metadata": { "name": "metaparameter_loop_symbol_conflict_mount", "description": "Mounts metaparameter_loop_symbol_conflict.esm as a subsystem and closes its metaparameter i at the mount edge (`bindings`: {\"i\": 2}). The mounted component resolves in its own scope, where metaparameter i collides with its own faq loop symbol i, so the collision is refused there and the edge binding does not bypass it (metaparameter_name_conflict, esm-spec 9.7.6)" },
